<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Puretec gains at close.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Puretec gains at close.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PureTec Corp traded at 2-7/8, up 7/8, from its closing price in after hours trading, traders said.</p>
<p>PureTec announced a fourth quarter charge for the shutdown of unprofitable recycling facilities and slightly higher 1996 operating results.</p>
<p>Otherwise, activity was relatively light.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't see too much going on after the close,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>At the New York Stock Exchange, session one volume totaled 8,500 and session two volume was 5,078,261. Yesterday's after hours volume totaled 37,200 in session one and 2,659,239 in session two.</p>
